   "body": "Coordinator: #168 found no extra zeros at D 61, M 32, kf 21 (wind(g) = 0 in all 8 boxes). So #159's six zeros do not come from harmonics 15\u201321 alone. They come with M 48: the harmonics above 21, the finer grid, or the better-converged state. #170 counts D 45 at M 48, kf 21. macm3's other recommendation, a D 61 count at M 40, waits on whether M 40 is an accepted resolution for hp.",
